    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "Thailand Foundation Celebrates Global Recognition of Pad Krapao (Thai Basil Stir-Fry) and Khanom Krok (Thai Coconut Pancakes) by TasteAtlas",
        "main_title": "Thailand Foundation Celebrates Global Recognition of Pad Krapao (Thai Basil Stir-Fry) and Khanom Krok (Thai Coconut Pancakes) by TasteAtlas",
        "author": "Thailand Foundation",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Two dishes. Two stories. One extraordinary culinary heritage.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Thailand Foundation is deeply proud to share that Pad Krapao (Thai Basil Stir-Fry) has been honored as #1 among the Top 100 Asian Stir-fry Dishes, and Khanom Krok (Thai Coconut Pancakes) has been named Thailand’s Best Dessert of 2026 by TasteAtlas, a world-renowned encyclopedic food map and travel guide.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "These are not just dishes. They are memories passed down through generations — the sizzle of a wok on a busy street corner, the warmth of a coconut pancake fresh from the mold. To see them celebrated on a world stage feels, in many ways, like seeing a piece of home recognized.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Thailand Foundation extends its heartfelt congratulations, and invites you to discover the stories, traditions, and flavors behind Thai cuisine:",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
